{
 "name": "Underground: long blends",
 "version": "1.0.0",
 "licence": "CC0-1.0",
 "author": "djmanzo crew",
 "description": "Techno and house mixed the long way: the current deck's bass, mids and highs out and back on one letter each (Shift brings it back), a filter, sixteen- and thirty-two-beat loops, thirty-two-beat jumps, quantize. On Space u, for underground; it adds the limiter to djmanzo's Mixer group as Space m l and m L.",
 "set": {
  "name": "Underground: long blends",
  "purpose": "club",
  "edition": "",
  "about": "Space u, for underground, on the current deck: u b bass out, u B back; u m mids out, u M back; u h highs out, u H back; u f filters down, u F opens; u l loops sixteen beats, u L thirty-two, u o lets go; u j jumps thirty-two forward, u J back; u s sync; u q quantize on, u Q off. Space m l and m L put the limiter on and off.",
  "keys": [
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "b"
    ],
    "label": "Bass out",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_low 0"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "B"
    ],
    "label": "Bass back",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_low 1"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "m"
    ],
    "label": "Mids out",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_mid 0"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "M"
    ],
    "label": "Mids back",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_mid 1"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "h"
    ],
    "label": "Highs out",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_high 0"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
     "u",
     "H"
    ],
    "label": "Highs back",
    "run": "action deck @ eq_high 1"
   },
   {
    "keys": [
